      55.89,
      386.17,
      546.85,
      421.24
    ],
    "text": "THE Interim Provisions of the Service Minute of Sri Lanka Information and Communication Technology Service, whichwas published in the Gazette Extraordinary of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 1894/26 dated 26.12.2014is hereby revised by adding the following Section under 15.4",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.89,
      434.17,
      547.08,
      493.24
    ],
    "text": "15.4 It is sufficient for the officers, who have been absorbed into Grade III of Class I or Grade II of Class 1 ofthe service in the Minute of Sri Lanka Information and Communication Technology Service as at 01.07.2009 and promotedto Grade II of Class I as at 02.07.2009 or later, to have completed a Post Graduate Diploma in an area mentioned inSection 10.5.1.1(i) of the Minute of Sri Lanka Information and Communication Technology Service, instead of the PostGraduate Degree qualification mentioned in the said Section, when promoting to Grade I of Class I up to 31.12.2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
